#: accounts/access.py:61
#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s's access is suspended."
msgstr "L'accès de %(name)s est suspendu."

#: accounts/access.py:70
#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s's access is reinstated."
msgstr "L'accès de %(name)s est rétabli."

#: accounts/access.py:95
#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s's access is revoked."
msgstr "L'accès de %(name)s est révoqué."

#: accounts/admission.py:33
msgid "How their registration with the bar was verified"
msgstr "Comment son inscription au barreau a été vérifiée"

#: accounts/admission.py:34
msgid "Who vouched for them"
msgstr "Qui assure son parrainage"

#: accounts/admission.py:37
msgid ""
"Through the bar directory's contact details, never those the person gave."
msgstr ""
"Par les coordonnées de l'annuaire du barreau, jamais celles données par la "
"personne."

#: accounts/admission.py:38
msgid "A trusted defence organisation or an admitted lawyer."
msgstr "Une organisation de défense de confiance, ou un·e avocat·e admis·e."

#: accounts/admission.py:44
msgid ""
"I compared this safety number with them, through the bar directory's contact "
"details."
msgstr ""
"J'ai comparé ce numéro de sécurité avec la personne, en la contactant par "
"les coordonnées de l'annuaire du barreau."

#: accounts/admission.py:100
msgid ""
"They can be admitted once they have set their password, two-factor "
"authentication and personal key."
msgstr ""
"La personne pourra être admise une fois son mot de passe, sa double "
"authentification et sa clé personnelle mis en place."

#: accounts/admission.py:103
msgid ""
"They have made a new key since this page was shown. Compare its safety "
"number with them again."
msgstr ""
"La personne a créé une nouvelle clé depuis l'affichage de cette page. "
"Comparez à nouveau son numéro de sécurité avec elle."

#: accounts/admission.py:108
#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s is admitted."
msgstr "%(name)s est admis·e."

#: accounts/invitations.py:38
msgid "Email address"
msgstr "Adresse e-mail"

#: accounts/invitations.py:38
msgid "The person's own professional address."
msgstr "L'adresse professionnelle de la personne elle-même."

#: accounts/invitations.py:40
msgid "First name"
msgstr "Prénom"

#: accounts/invitations.py:41
msgid "Last name"
msgstr "Nom"

#: accounts/invitations.py:42
msgid "Bar"
msgstr "Barreau"

#: accounts/invitations.py:50 accounts/invitations.py:85
msgid "An account already uses this address."
msgstr "Un compte utilise déjà cette adresse."

#: accounts/invitations.py:59
msgid "Invite this address anyway"
msgstr "Inviter quand même cette adresse"

#: accounts/invitations.py:62
msgid ""
"This address belonged to a lawyer whose access was revoked. Tick the box to "
"invite it again, as a new applicant who needs verifying and a vouch like "
"anyone else."
msgstr ""
"Cette adresse appartenait à un·e avocat·e à l'accès révoqué. Cochez la case "
"pour l'inviter de nouveau, comme nouvelle candidature, à vérifier et à "
"parrainer comme toute autre."

#: accounts/invitations.py:93
#, python-format
msgid "An invitation link went to %(email)s."
msgstr "Un lien d'invitation a été envoyé à %(email)s."

#: accounts/invitations.py:123
msgid "Your invitation to the footage archive"
msgstr "Votre invitation à l'archive de vidéos"

#: accounts/models.py:71
msgid "email address"
msgstr "adresse e-mail"

#: accounts/models.py:123 accounts/templates/accounts/applicant_review.html:4
msgid "Applicant"
msgstr "Candidat·e"

#: accounts/models.py:124
msgid "Declined applicant"
msgstr "Candidat·e non retenu·e"

#: accounts/models.py:126
msgid "Lawyer"
msgstr "Avocat·e"

#: accounts/models.py:127
msgid "Suspended lawyer"
msgstr "Avocat·e à l'accès suspendu"

#: accounts/models.py:128
msgid "Revoked lawyer"
msgstr "Avocat·e à l'accès révoqué"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/accept_invitation.html:4
#: accounts/templates/accounts/accept_invitation.html:9
msgid "Set your password"
msgstr "Définissez votre mot de passe"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/accept_invitation.html:10
msgid "Next, you will set up two-factor authentication."
msgstr "Ensuite, vous activerez la double authentification."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/accept_invitation.html:14
msgid "Set the password"
msgstr "Enregistrer le mot de passe"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/accept_invitation.html:17
msgid "This link no longer works"
msgstr "Ce lien ne fonctionne plus"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/accept_invitation.html:18
msgid ""
"It has been used already, has expired, or a newer link was sent. Ask the "
"admin for a new one."
msgstr ""
"Il a déjà servi, il a expiré, ou un lien plus récent a été envoyé. Demandez-"
"en un nouveau à l'administrateur·rice."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant.html:4
#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant.html:7
msgid "Waiting for admission"
msgstr "En attente d'admission"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant.html:8
msgid ""
"Your account is ready, but the admin has not admitted you yet. Until then, "
"the archive shows you nothing."
msgstr ""
"Votre compte est prêt, mais l'administrateur·rice ne vous a pas encore "
"admis·e. D'ici là, l'archive ne vous montre rien."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant.html:10
msgid "Your personal key and its safety number"
msgstr "Votre clé personnelle et son numéro de sécurité"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant.html:12
msgid "Before you can be admitted, set up your personal key."
msgstr "Avant de pouvoir être admis·e, créez votre clé personnelle."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant.html:12
#: keys/templates/keys/setup.html:4 keys/templates/keys/setup.html:14
msgid "Set up your personal key"
msgstr "Créer votre clé personnelle"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant_review.html:8
msgid "Bar:"
msgstr "Barreau :"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant_review.html:9
msgid "Email address:"
msgstr "Adresse e-mail :"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant_review.html:11
msgid ""
"They have set their password, two-factor authentication and personal key."
msgstr ""
"La personne a défini son mot de passe, activé la double authentification et "
"créé sa clé personnelle."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant_review.html:11
msgid ""
"They have not yet set their password, two-factor authentication and personal "
"key: they cannot be admitted before then."
msgstr ""
"La personne n'a pas encore défini son mot de passe, activé la double "
"authentification et créé sa clé personnelle : elle ne peut pas être admise "
"avant."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant_review.html:13
msgid "Safety number of their key:"
msgstr "Numéro de sécurité de sa clé :"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant_review.html:14
msgid ""
"Before admitting them, contact them through the bar directory's contact "
"details, never those they gave, and ask them to read the safety number shown "
"on their key page. Admit them only if it is the same as this one."
msgstr ""
"Avant d'admettre la personne, contactez-la par les coordonnées de l'annuaire "
"du barreau, jamais par celles qu'elle a données, et demandez-lui de lire le "
"numéro de sécurité affiché sur sa page de clé. Ne l'admettez que s'il est "
"identique à celui-ci."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant_review.html:17
msgid "Admit"
msgstr "Admettre"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant_review.html:18
msgid ""
"Admit them only once their registration with the bar is verified and someone "
"has vouched for them."
msgstr ""
"N'admettez la personne qu'une fois son inscription au barreau vérifiée et "
"son parrainage obtenu."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant_review.html:22
msgid "Admit as a lawyer"
msgstr "Admettre comme avocat·e"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant_review.html:25
#: accounts/templates/accounts/decline.html:12
msgid "Decline"
msgstr "Ne pas retenir"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/applicant_review.html:26
#: accounts/templates/accounts/decline.html:4
#: accounts/templates/accounts/decline.html:7
msgid "Decline this applicant"
msgstr "Ne pas retenir cette candidature"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/decline.html:8
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(name)s will no longer be able to log in. Their name, bar and email address "
"will be erased. This cannot be undone; they can be invited again later as a "
"new applicant."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s ne pourra plus se connecter. Son nom, son barreau et son adresse e-"
"mail seront effacés. C'est définitif ; la personne pourra plus tard être "
"invitée de nouveau, comme nouveau·elle candidat·e."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/decline.html:11
msgid "I confirm"
msgstr "Je confirme"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/invitation_email.txt:1
msgid ""
"You have been invited to the footage archive for defence lawyers.\n"
"\n"
"Set your password here:"
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes invité·e à rejoindre l'archive de vidéos pour les avocat·es de la "
"défense.\n"
"\n"
"Définissez votre mot de passe ici :"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/invitation_email.txt:7
#, python-format
msgid "The link works once and expires in %(days)s day."
msgid_plural "The link works once and expires in %(days)s days."
msgstr[0] "Le lien fonctionne une fois et expire dans %(days)s jour."
msgstr[1] "Le lien fonctionne une fois et expire dans %(days)s jours."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/invitation_email.txt:8
msgid "If you did not expect this invitation, ignore this email."
msgstr "Si vous n'attendiez pas cette invitation, ignorez ce message."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/invite.html:4
#: accounts/templates/accounts/invite.html:7
#: accounts/templates/accounts/manage_home.html:22
msgid "Send an invitation"
msgstr "Envoyer une invitation"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/invite.html:8
msgid ""
"The person receives a link by email to set their password. They are an "
"applicant, and see nothing, until you admit them."
msgstr ""
"La personne reçoit par e-mail un lien pour définir son mot de passe. Elle "
"reste candidat·e, et ne voit rien, tant que vous ne l'avez pas admise."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/invite.html:12
msgid "Send the invitation"
msgstr "Envoyer l'invitation"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/lawyer_home.html:4
#: accounts/templates/accounts/lawyer_home.html:7
