"Give the place and radius from the police report, or pick the area on the "
"map."
msgstr ""
"Donnez le lieu et le rayon du procès-verbal, ou choisissez le périmètre sur "
"la carte."

#: cases/forms.py:200
#, python-format
msgid ""
"With its margin, this case lasts %(minutes)s minutes and is about %(metres)s "
"m across. No case can last more than %(ceiling_minutes)s minutes or be more "
"than %(ceiling_metres)s m across."
msgstr ""
"Avec sa marge, ce dossier de recherche couvre %(minutes)s minutes et environ "
"%(metres)s m de large. Aucun dossier de recherche ne peut dépasser "
"%(ceiling_minutes)s minutes ni %(ceiling_metres)s m de large."

#: cases/forms.py:207
#, python-format
msgid ""
"With its margin, this case lasts %(minutes)s minutes and is about %(metres)s "
"m across. Without the admin's approval, a case lasts at most %(cap_minutes)s "
"minutes and is at most %(cap_metres)s m across. To ask for it, give your "
"reason in the field \"Why this case needs to be larger than the size caps\"."
msgstr ""
"Avec sa marge, ce dossier de recherche couvre %(minutes)s minutes et environ "
"%(metres)s m de large. Sans validation par l'administrateur·rice, un dossier "
"de recherche couvre au plus %(cap_minutes)s minutes et %(cap_metres)s m de "
"large. Pour demander cette validation, donnez votre justification dans le "
"champ « Pourquoi ce dossier de recherche doit dépasser les plafonds »."

